              "Schema version."
            ],
            "type": "u8"
          },
          {
            "name": "agent_pubkey",
            "docs": [
              "Stable identity key — also baked into the PDA seed."
            ],
            "type": "pubkey"
          },
          {
            "name": "owner",
            "docs": [
              "Owning user wallet. Immutable — set at mint and never changes."
